.el .ds Aq '
.TH start-registry-package-sign 1  "sign " 
.SH NAME
start\-registry\-package\-sign \- Add your signature to a package in the registry index
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-registry package sign\fR [\fB\-\-no\-verify\fR] [\fB\-\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add your signature to a package in the registry index
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-verify\fR
Sign the commitments the registry lists instead of a local s9pk
.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR \fI<ID>\fR
Package identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<VERSION>\fR
Package version
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
Path to s9pk package file
